  "title": "Lument Finance Trust Declares Q2 2026 Cash Dividends",
  "summary": "New York, NY, June 10, 2026/PRNewswire – Lument Finance Trust, Inc. (NYSE: LFT) (“LFT” or the “Company”) announced the declaration of a cash dividend of $0.04 per share of common stock with respect to the second quarter of 2026. The dividend is payable on July 15, 2026, to common stockholders of record as of the close of business",
